DISTRIBUTION

Every family above is under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 or the Apache License
2.0. Both permit redistribution and embedding in applications, including
commercial ones, provided the copyright notice and the license text stay with
the font files. That is what the per-directory OFL.txt / LICENSE.txt files are
for; do not strip them when vendoring a package.

Roboto is OFL, not Apache. Google relicensed the family, and the file embedded
here is the post-relicense cut (Version 3.015). Roboto Slab is a separate family
and is still Apache 2.0 -- the two are easy to conflate.

Lato is distributed with the Reserved Font Name "Lato". Under OFL 1.1 clause 3 a
modified version may not use that name. Every font in this repository is an
unmodified upstream release, so the reservation is satisfied by leaving them
that way. Do not re-generate, subset or re-hint these files in place.
